/* ORI.W #<data>,Dn is the word-sized data-register form from the MC68000
 * Family Programmer's Reference Manual §4 ORI, pp. 4-153 to 4-154. It ORs
 * the immediate word into Dn[15:0], preserves Dn[31:16] and X, sets N/Z from
 * the word result, and clears V/C. User's Manual Rev. 9.1 Table 8-5 (p. 8-5)
 * specifies 8 clocks and 2 reads for ORI byte/word to Dn. */
